meta {
  name: 14. Change Group Status (Owner)
  type: http
  seq: 14
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{settlementGroupId}}/status
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "status": "{{settlementGroupStatus}}"
  }
}

docs {
  # Change Group Status

  PATCH /api/v1/groups/:groupID/status. Bearer authentication required; group owner or site ADMIN. Uses manual settlementGroupId and settlementGroupStatus environment keys.

  Body status is the uppercase case-sensitive enum ACTIVE, SETTLING, CLOSED. Forward transitions: ACTIVE -> SETTLING -> CLOSED. Sending the current state is harmless. Reopening and skipping SETTLING are forbidden. POST /groups/:groupID/archive is retained as an alias for moving to SETTLING.

  ACTIVE permits normal operations. SETTLING freezes expenses/polls/draws while still accepting payment registration/confirmation/rejection/pending deletion. CLOSED freezes writes; active members can read history. Close only after all PENDING payments have been confirmed, rejected, deleted or canceled. Existing INACTIVE group rows migrate to SETTLING; membership ACTIVE/INACTIVE and poll ACTIVE/INACTIVE are unchanged.

  200 success envelope with the existing GroupResponse. status contains the new state. archived_at records transition to SETTLING, closed_at records transition to CLOSED (omitted before closure). No settlement is auto-confirmed. Closing a group with remaining net debts is permitted once no PENDING payment remains; this endpoint does not enforce zero debt.

  Example JSON body: {"status":"SETTLING"}

  Errors: 400 GROUP_INVALID_ID, 400 GROUP_INVALID_STATUS (status must be ACTIVE, SETTLING or CLOSED), 401 token errors, 403 GROUP_FORBIDDEN (not owner/admin), 404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND, 409 GROUP_STATUS_TRANSITION (forward transitions only), 409 GROUP_PENDING_SETTLEMENTS (resolve pending payments before closing the group), 500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR. Standard error envelope is {"success":false,"code":"GROUP_PENDING_SETTLEMENTS","error":"resolve pending payments before closing the group"}.
}
